[
    {
        "id": "bf424b7fa28ce733",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "DCDC Controller",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# Bi-Di DC/DC Control\n* Control Data Flow\n* Control Logic\n* Panel (Async Web Interface)\n* Node-RED Dashboard 2.0 (VUE App)\n\n\n## EDCS50-M-M HW Module Data\nHigh-Side DC Output/Input Data:\n* V_HS_MAX = 1000 V\n* V_HS_MIN = 300 V\n* I_HS_MAX = 80 A\n* P_MAX = 50 kW\n\nLow-Side DC Input/Output Data:\n* V_LS_MAX = 900 V\n* V_LS_MIN = 0 V (But setpoint limit 60V)\n* I_LS_MAX = 100 A\n",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "821d298e5389a95d",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "DCDC Setup + Diagnostics",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Errors Can Lead to HW Failure!\n\n# DCDC Setup and Diagnostics\n* Initial Programming of HW Device\n* Read-Out of Diagnostc and Service Data\n* FLASH",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "bd71ca1db613388c",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "ACDC Controller",
        "disabled": true,
        "info": "# AC/DC Control\n* Control Data Flow\n* Control Logic\n* Panel (Async Web Interface)\n* Node-RED Dashboard 2.0 (VUE App)\n\n## REG50050 HW Module Data\nCommunication Interface:\n* CAN 2.0 (EF, 29-Bit Id)\n* 125 kBit/s\n\nAC Output/Input Data:\n* Three-Phase AC\n* Four-Conductor Circuit L1 - L2 -L3 - PE\n* V_AC_MIN = 260 V\n* V_AC_MAX = 530 V\n* I_AC_MAX = 32 A\n\nDC Input/Output Data:\n* V_DC_MIN = 150 V\n* V_DC_MAX = 500 V\n* I_DC_MIN = 0 A\n* I_DC_MAX = 50 A",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "ef43eabf9f8a3cae",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "MQTT Receiver",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# Receive UDS Diagnostic Readout Data over MQTT",
        "env": []
    },
